=520  \\$aPresents information on legal citation, provided by Peter W. Martin. Discusses the purposes of legal citation and the general types of citation rules. Highlights how to cite cases, constitutions, regulations, arbitrations, rules of evidence, law journal writing, and documents from earlier stages of a case. Contains example citations, as well as abbreviations and omissions used in citations. Offers information on underlining in citations and text.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
