=520  \\$aThe Santa Clara Journal of International Law hopes to redefine legal journalism by publishing an easily accessible, entirely web-based international law journal composed of rigorous, accessible, and intellectually sound material. Each journal volume contains materials from a diverse representation of international scholars. In addition to the online journal, book reviews and articles are posted on the website. The Journal also hosts an annual symposium at Santa Clara University, School of Law.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
