=520  \\$aIn honor of the Great American Smokeout on November 20, this month’s other featured site is Legacy tobacco documents library. This site offers searching, viewing, and downloading of over 8 million documents which relate to scientific research, manufacturing, marketing, litigation and legislation, and advertising and sales of cigarettes, among other topics. These documents generally date from the 1950’s to recent years. The Legacy tobacco documents library is part of the Tobacco control archives, which was a previous Website of the Month selection.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
