=520  \\$aPresents biographical information on and speeches and writings of U.S. President Abraham Lincoln (1809-1865), emphasizing Lincoln’s Illinois years from 1815-1861. Also provides a database of primary source materials related to antebellum life in Illinois, featuring letters, diaries, political pamphlets, songbooks, and hyperlinks to resources related to Lincoln’s political and social context. Includes discussions of eight historical themes and an online Lincoln biography.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
