=520  \\$aThe IACHR is a principal and autonomous organ of the Organization of American States (“OAS”) whose mission is to promote and protect human rights in the American hemisphere. It is composed of seven independent members who serve in a personal capacity. The website offers information about the Commission and its activities. Provides free online access to its annual report, reports on the situation of human rights in individual countries, and other special reports.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
