=520  \\$aSupplement to the book entitled “The Wrong Carlos.” This website provides extensive primary sources and videotaped witness interviews for the murder of a convenience store clerk named Wanda Vargas Lo´pez. It uncovers the controversial death penalty justice in Texas and is the case of Carlos DeLuna, who was executed in 1989.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
