=520  \\$aOfficial website of the Court of Justice of the European Union and its constituent courts. The site provides access to information about the Court of Justice, the General Court (formerly the Court of First Instance of the European Communities), and the Civil Service Tribunal. It includes the full text of judgments, orders, opinions and notices, and allows searching of cases from the courts. The specific mission of CJEU is to ensure that the law is observed in the interpretation and application of the Treaties of the European Union by 1) reviewing the legality of actions taken by the EU’s institutions; 2) enforcing compliance by member states with their obligations under the Treaties, and 3) interpreting European Union law.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
