=520  \\$aForeign law web archive is a collection of foreign legal materials. Included are official gazettes and judicial websites. Many foreign legal materials are now posted online, with some jurisdictions dispensing with a print publication entirely. Certain jurisdictions’ legal materials are challenging to acquire or considered at risk of disappearing from the Web. An official Gazette is a government publication that generally contains the first version of the text of legislation, regulations, rules, legal notices, treaties, and court cases for foreign countries.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
