=520  \\$aHG.org, founded in January 1995, is one of the very first online law and government information sites to make law, government and related professional information easily and freely accessible to the legal profession, businesses, and consumers. HG.org includes a directory of law firms and networks covering 195 countries with 5,000 cities in 260 practice areas. Its expert witness directory covers expertise in 1,500 general areas and 700 diseases and medical conditions.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
