=520  \\$aThe 3rd Edition of Patent Law: Cases, Problems, and Materials is a public accessible patent law casebook. The full casebook PDF is downloadable online free of charge, and a print version is available at-cost from Amazon. The focus of this casebook is on bringing conceptual clarity to the details of modern patent practice, while also placing patent law in its social context. Many practice problems are introduced throughout the casebook to apply patent doctrines to fact patterns from real cases and to hypotheticals constructed to isolate and explain difficult concepts.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
