=520  \\$aThe World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO) is the global forum for intellectual property (IP) services, policy, and information. The mission of the organization is to lead the development of a balanced and effective international IP system. The WIPO Lex Database is a one-stop search for the intellectual property (IP) laws, regulations, WIPO-administered treaties and IP‑related treaties, and IP judgments. The WIPO Lex Website features related information to analyze and interpret these laws and treaties.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
