=520  \\$aGovInfo is a service of the U.S. Government Publishing Office (GPO), a federal agency within the legislative branch and provides public access to official publications from all three branches of the Federal Government. GPO launched GovInfo in February 2016 to replace its predecessor, the Federal Digital System (FDsys). GovInfo was redesigned to incorporate user feedback and improve search and access to electronic federal government information. The mobile-friendly site uses innovative technologies and offers new features to enhance the overall user experience.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
