=520  \\$aThis resource provides public access to the Trade Law casebook, beginning with The History of U.S. Trademark Law and The Origins of Trademarks and Trademark Law, highlighting how the early development of trademark law raises questions that continue to concern courts and policymakers–particularly regarding the proper rationale for trademark protection and the scope of trademark rights.$cLSRD-SIS Legal Website of the Month
